{"id":"29d3779cb3a059e6","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-homs.md","title":"Homomorphisms","display":"df-homs — Homomorphisms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homs","aliases":["58-df-homs","Homomorphisms"],"display":"df-homs — Homomorphisms","depends_on":["[[58-df-algebraic-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homs</span><span>Homomorphisms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homs — Homomorphisms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17481145f095cfb1\" href=\"?note=17481145f095cfb1\" title=\"58-df-algebraic-structure\">58-df-algebraic-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\Omega)\">\\((A,\\Omega)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,\\Omega&#39;)\">\\((B,\\Omega&#39;)\\)</span> (algebraic structures with the common operation-index family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17481145f095cfb1\" href=\"?note=17481145f095cfb1\" title=\"58-df-algebraic-structure\">58-df-algebraic-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S(\\phi,(A,\\Omega),(B,\\Omega&#39;),I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S(\\phi,(A,\\Omega),(B,\\Omega&#39;),I)\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_S\\)</span> (homomorphism predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Endo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Endo}_S\\)</span> (endomorphism predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ker(\\phi),\\operatorname{im}(\\phi)\">\\(\\ker(\\phi),\\operatorname{im}(\\phi)\\)</span> (kernel and image of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homs} \\vdash \\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,B,\\Omega&#39;,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\land\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(B,\\Omega&#39;,I)\\land\\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S(\\phi,(A,\\Omega),(B,\\Omega&#39;),I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homs} \\vdash \\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,B,\\Omega&#39;,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\land\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(B,\\Omega&#39;,I)\\land\\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S(\\phi,(A,\\Omega),(B,\\Omega&#39;),I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homs\\text{-}endomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Endo}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,A,\\Omega,I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homs\\text{-}endomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Endo}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,A,\\Omega,I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homs\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image} \\vdash \\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,B,\\Omega&#39;,I)\\to\\left(\\ker(\\phi)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,a&#39;\\rangle\\in A^2:\\phi(a)=\\phi(a&#39;)\\}\\land\\operatorname{im}(\\phi)\\coloneqq\\{\\phi(a):a\\in A\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homs\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image} \\vdash \\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,B,\\Omega&#39;,I)\\to\\left(\\ker(\\phi)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,a&#39;\\rangle\\in A^2:\\phi(a)=\\phi(a&#39;)\\}\\land\\operatorname{im}(\\phi)\\coloneqq\\{\\phi(a):a\\in A\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For an arbitrary algebraic signature, the kernel is the kernel congruence on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>. The zero-fiber description applies only to suitably pointed algebraic categories such as groups or modules.</li>\n<li>Isomorphism: bijective homomorphism; automorphism if domain = codomain</li>\n<li>Noether: first isomorphism theorem; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A/\\ker \\phi \\cong \\operatorname{im} \\phi\">\\(A/\\ker \\phi \\cong \\operatorname{im} \\phi\\)</span></li>\n<li>Natural: morphisms compose; category of algebras has objects as algebras, morphisms as homomorphisms</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n<li>Burris and Sankappanavar, A Course in Universal Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-algebraic-structure","status":"resolved","id":"17481145f095cfb1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-algebraic-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-algebraic-structure","status":"resolved","id":"17481145f095cfb1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(A,\\Omega)$ and $(B,\\Omega')$ (algebraic structures with the common operation-index family $I$, see [[58-df-algebraic-structure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(A,\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"(B,\\Omega')","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S(\\phi,(A,\\Omega),(B,\\Omega'),I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Endo}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\ker(\\phi),\\operatorname{im}(\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homs} \\vdash \\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,B,\\Omega',I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(A,\\Omega,I)\\land\\mathrm{AlgStruct}_S(B,\\Omega',I)\\land\\mathrm{Homomorphism}_S(\\phi,(A,\\Omega),(B,\\Omega'),I)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homs\\text{-}endomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Endo}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,A,\\Omega,I)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homs\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image} \\vdash \\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\phi,A,\\Omega,B,\\Omega',I)\\to\\left(\\ker(\\phi)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,a'\\rangle\\in A^2:\\phi(a)=\\phi(a')\\}\\land\\operatorname{im}(\\phi)\\coloneqq\\{\\phi(a):a\\in A\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A/\\ker \\phi \\cong \\operatorname{im} \\phi","display":false}],"bytes":1892,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-646","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-homs.md|58-df-homs]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["17481145f095cfb1"]}